flowchart LR
  subgraph PHONE[Physical iPhone - foreground only]
    A[Accelerometer one sample every 5 s + GPS] --> B[SwiftUI commute recorder]
    B --> C[(Local SQLite + durable outbox)]
    C --> D[HTTPS uploader - ~1 second batches]
    W[Weather collector - every 60 seconds] --> C
  end
  subgraph FIREBASE[Firebase - cloud]
    AUTH[Email/password Authentication]
    DB[(Realtime Database JSON - europe-west1 Belgium)]
    RULES[Rules: auth.uid matches users/uid]
    AUTH --> RULES
    RULES --> DB
  end
  D -->|ID token + PUT + server receipt timestamp| RULES
  MET[Met Eireann - hourly Dublin Airport observations] -->|HTTPS JSON| W
